  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 - Hesap",
      "description": "En hizli smoke test. Once buradan basla.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Bakiye Sorgula",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/user/credit",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["user", "credit"]
            },
            "description": "Token gecerli mi ve hesapta bakiye var mi?\n\n- `401` → token yanlis ya da API erisimi acilmamis\n- `{\"data\":{\"credit\":null}}` → **token dogru**, hesapta yuklu bakiye yok\n- `{\"data\":{\"credit\":47.5}}` → her sey yolunda\n\nBakiyesiz gonderi olusturulamaz."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Istek basarili', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const credit = body.data ? body.data.credit : body.credit;",
                  "",
                  "if (credit === null || credit === undefined) {",
                  "  console.log('Token calisiyor ama bakiye bildirilmedi — hesaba bakiye yukleyin.');",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('Bakiye: ' + credit + ' TL');",
                  "  pm.test('Bakiye pozitif', () => pm.expect(Number(credit)).to.be.above(0));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 - Lokasyon",
      "description": "Kargonomi il/ilce id'leri. Gonderi olustururken isim degil id isteniyor.\nBu iki istek `state_id` ve `city_id` degiskenlerini otomatik doldurur.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Iller (Turkiye)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/states/1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["states", "1"],
              "variable": []
            },
            "description": "Yol sonundaki `1` ulke id'si (Turkiye). Bos birakilirsa da Turkiye varsayilir.\n81 il donmeli."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Istek basarili', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const states = Array.isArray(body.data) ? body.data : body;",
                  "pm.test('Il listesi geldi', () => pm.expect(states.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "console.log(states.length + ' il geldi');",
                  "",
                  "// Sonraki istekler icin bir il sec: Istanbul varsa o, yoksa ilk sira.",
                  "const istanbul = states.find(s => (s.name || '').toLocaleLowerCase('tr').indexOf('stanbul') > -1);",
                  "const chosen = istanbul || states[0];",
                  "if (chosen) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('state_id', chosen.id);",
                  "  console.log('state_id = ' + chosen.id + ' (' + chosen.name + ')');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Ilceler (secili il)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/cities/{{state_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["cities", "{{state_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Secili ilin ilceleri. `state_id` bir onceki istekle doluyor."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Istek basarili', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const cities = Array.isArray(body.data) ? body.data : body;",
                  "pm.test('Ilce listesi geldi', () => pm.expect(cities.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "",
                  "const kadikoy = cities.find(c => (c.name || '').toLocaleLowerCase('tr').indexOf('kad') === 0);",
                  "const chosen = kadikoy || cities[0];",
                  "if (chosen) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('city_id', chosen.id);",
                  "  console.log('city_id = ' + chosen.id + ' (' + chosen.name + ')');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 - Gonderi Olusturma",
      "description": "Iki fazli akis: once taslak olusur, sonra tasiyici onaylanir.\n\n**Taslak olusturmak ucretsizdir.** Ucret, tasiyici onaylandiginda dusulur.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Taslak Gonderi Olustur (ucretsiz)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"shipment\": {\n    \"buyer_name\": \"Test Alici\",\n    \"buyer_phone\": \"5001234567\",\n    \"buyer_address\": \"Test Mahallesi Deneme Sokak No 1 Daire 2\",\n    \"buyer_state_id\": {{state_id}},\n    \"buyer_city_id\": {{city_id}},\n    \"buyer_email\": \"test@example.com\",\n    \"packages\": [\n      {\n        \"desi\": 3,\n        \"content\": \"Test gonderi\",\n        \"barcode\": \"TEST-0001\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/shipments",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["shipments"]
            },
            "description": "Zorunlu alanlar:\n- `buyer_name` (5-255 karakter)\n- `buyer_phone` (**10 hane, basinda 0 yok**)\n- `buyer_address` (10-512 karakter)\n- `buyer_state_id`, `buyer_city_id` (Lokasyon klasorunden)\n- `packages[]` — en az bir koli, her birinde `desi` > 0\n\nGondericiyi belirtmenin iki yolu var:\n1. Govdeye `\"warehouse_id\": 123` ekle (Kargonomi'deki depo) — onerilen\n2. `sender_name`, `sender_phone`, `sender_address`, `sender_state_id`, `sender_city_id` alanlarini tek tek gonder\n\nHicbiri yoksa Kargonomi hesabin varsayilan deposunu kullanir.\n\n**Bu adim ucret dogurmaz**, sadece taslak yaratir."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Gonderi olustu', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 422) {",
                  "  console.log('Dogrulama hatasi — govdedeki alanlari kontrol edin:');",
                  "  console.log(pm.response.text());",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "try {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const shipment = body.data || body;",
                  "  if (shipment && shipment.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('shipment_id', shipment.id);",
                  "    console.log('shipment_id = ' + shipment.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "  console.log('Yanit JSON degil: ' + pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Fiyat Karsilastirma (ucretsiz)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/shipment-price-comparison/{{shipment_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["shipment-price-comparison", "{{shipment_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Taslak gonderi icin her tasiyicinin fiyati.\nYanitta `shipping_provider_with_price` dizisi gelir; her elemanda `id`, `slug`, `name`, `price`.\n\nBir sonraki adimda kullanacagin `shipping_provider_id` degeri buradaki `id`.\n\n`slug` degerleri, site ayarlarindaki **Kargo Firmalari > Kargonomi Slug** alanina yazilacak olanlardir."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Istek basarili', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = body.data || body;",
                  "const offers = data.shipping_provider_with_price || [];",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('En az bir tasiyici teklifi var', () => pm.expect(offers.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "",
                  "offers.forEach(o => console.log(o.slug + ' (' + o.id + ') = ' + o.price + ' TL — ' + o.name));",
                  "",
                  "// En ucuzu sonraki adim icin hazirla.",
                  "if (offers.length) {",
                  "  const cheapest = offers.slice().sort((a, b) => Number(a.price) - Number(b.price))[0];",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('cheapest_provider_id', cheapest.id);",
                  "  console.log('En ucuz: ' + cheapest.slug + ' → provider_id ' + cheapest.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Tasiyici Sec (ONAYLA - UCRET DUSULUR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"shipment_id\": {{shipment_id}},\n  \"shipping_provider_id\": -1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/confirm-shipping-price",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["confirm-shipping-price"]
            },
            "description": "**DIKKAT: Bu adim gonderiyi kesinlestirir ve bakiyeden dusulur.**\n\n`shipping_provider_id`:\n- `-1` → Kargonomi otomatik en ucuzu secer\n- Fiyat karsilastirmadan gelen bir `id` → o tasiyici ile gonderilir\n\nOnayladiktan sonra Kargonomi arka planda kargo siparisini olusturur; takip numarasi birkac dakika icinde `GET /shipments/{id}` ile gorunur.\n\nYanlislikla olusturduysan **36 saat icinde** `Gonderi Yonetimi > Gonderi Iptal` ile iptal edebilirsin."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Onay kabul edildi', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "console.log('Gonderi onaylandi. Takip numarasi icin birkac dakika sonra Gonderi Detay istegini calistirin.');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
