        {
          "name": "Gonderi Detay",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/shipments/{{shipment_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["shipments", "{{shipment_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Tek gonderinin tam hali. Takip numarasi `shipping_webservice_tracking_code` alaninda.\n\n**Onemli:** Bu uc, Kargonomi'nin kendi gonderi id'sini ister — kargo firmasinin takip numarasini degil."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Istek basarili', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const s = body.data || body;",
                  "console.log('Durum: ' + s.status);",
                  "console.log('Takip no: ' + (s.shipping_webservice_tracking_code || 'henuz yok'));",
                  "console.log('Tasiyici: ' + (s.shipping_provider_name || '-') + ' / ' + (s.shipping_provider_slug || '-'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Alici Bilgisi Duzelt (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"shipment\": {\n    \"buyer_phone\": \"5009876543\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/shipments/{{shipment_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["shipments", "{{shipment_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Sadece degistirmek istedigin alanlari gonder. Yanlis telefon ya da eksik daire no icin ideal — iptal edip yeniden olusturmaya gerek kalmaz.\n\nIl/ilce degistiriyorsan **ikisini birlikte** gonder (`buyer_state_id` + `buyer_city_id`); baska ile ait bir ilce id'si adresi bozar."
          },
          "response": []
        },
